 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Nice of you, gifts make people feel special. What kind of touch points do they have with you? Weekly after game talks, email, they live nearby? Stick your finger in and pull it out both ways. In and out means you switched with yourself. If it goes yes, then it' inside. If it goes no, then it's outside. Turn the wheel so it reads yes when it' neutral. A card works, it has the advantage that you keep it, you don't need another person for verification. Signing everyone together is the standard and fastest, it only takes a few minutes.",
